@startuml
state Homepage [*]
state ProjectPage
    state PhotoView
    state VideoView
state CareerOpportunitiesPage
    state Updates
    state ApplicationForm
state SubmittedJobApplication

Homepage --> ProjectPage: User clicks on a project
ProjectPage --|> PhotoView: User chooses photos
ProjectPage --|> VideoView: User chooses videos
Homepage --> CareerOpportunitiesPage: User clicks on career opportunities
CareerOpportunitiesPage --|> Updates: User chooses updates
CareerOpportunitiesPage --|> ApplicationForm: User chooses to apply
ProjectPage ||| SubmittedJobApplication: Job application is submitted
CareerOpportunitiesPage ||| SubmittedJobApplication: Job application is submitted
SubmittedJobApplication --> Homepage: System behavior after job application check not detailed
@enduml
